ta-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"person; people\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chéng jì\" data-defn=\"achievement / performance records / grades\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">成绩</span><span class=\"tr\">成績</span><rt>chéng jì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hé\" data-defn=\"and; together with\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"each / every\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">各</span><span class=\"tr\">各</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fāng miàn\" data-defn=\"respect / aspect / field / side\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">方面</span><span class=\"tr\">方面</span><rt>fāng miàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"néng lì\" data-defn=\"capability / ability\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">能力</span><span class=\"tr\">能力</span><rt>néng lì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōu\" data-defn=\"all; both; entirely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn\" data-defn=\"very; quite\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī bān\" data-defn=\"ordinary / so-so / common / general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">一般</span><span class=\"tr\">一般</span><rt>yī bān</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hòu lái\" data-defn=\"afterwards; later\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">后来</span><span class=\"tr\">後來</span>